{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1205","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Expected Value Again"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given integers $$$n$$$, $$$k$$$. Let's consider the alphabet consisting of $$$k$$$ different elements."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beauty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(s)$$$ of the string $$$s$$$ be the number of indexes $$$i$$$, $$$1\\le i \\lt |s|$$$, for which prefix of $$$s$$$ of length $$$i$$$ equals to suffix of $$$s$$$ of length $$$i$$$. For example, beauty of the string $$$abacaba$$$ equals $$$2$$$, as for $$$i = 1, 3$$$ prefix and suffix of length $$$i$$$ are equal."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider all words of length $$$n$$$ in the given alphabet. Find the expected value of $$$f(s)^2$$$ of a uniformly chosen at random word. We can show that it can be expressed as $$$\\frac{P}{Q}$$$, where $$$P$$$ and $$$Q$$$ are coprime and $$$Q$$$ isn't divided by $$$10^9 + 7$$$. Output $$$P\\cdot Q^{-1} \\bmod 10^9 + 7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first and the only line contains two integers $$$n$$$, $$$k$$$ ($$$1\\le n \\le 10^5$$$, $$$1\\le k\\le 10^9$$$) — the length of a string and the size of alphabet respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer — $$$P\\times Q^{-1} \\bmod 10^9 + 7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n333333336\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n100 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9801\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n412377396\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, there are $$$9$$$ words of length $$$2$$$ in alphabet of size $$$3$$$ — $$$aa$$$, $$$ab$$$, $$$ac$$$, $$$ba$$$, $$$bb$$$, $$$bc$$$, $$$ca$$$, $$$cb$$$, $$$cc$$$. $$$3$$$ of them have beauty $$$1$$$ and $$$6$$$ of them have beauty $$$0$$$, so the average value is $$$\\frac{1}{3}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, there is only one such word, and it has beauty $$$99$$$, so the average value is $$$99^2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1205E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1205/problem/E"}